	<name>T01 timber 1386 ac</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 51%), 1386 ac public, 9,462-10,855 ft, 34% north-facing; median 1.6 mi (max 2.42 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F5-04 meadow 9908 (3.72 mi). Imagery: dense live conifer (core checked on satellite 2025-05-11 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-22).</description>
