  <Placemark id="Security_timber.3">
	<name>T03 timber 1142 ac</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 51%), 1142 ac public, 9,808-10,730 ft, 2% north-facing; median 0.84 mi (max 1.61 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F5-04 meadow 9908 (5.26 mi). Imagery: live, moderately dense (core checked on satellite 2025-05-11 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-22).</description>
