  <Placemark id="Security_timber.4">
	<name>T04 timber 816 ac</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 51%), 816 ac public, 9,657-10,976 ft, 56% north-facing; median 1.46 mi (max 2.07 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F5-04 meadow 9908 (1.97 mi). Imagery: dense live conifer, small parks inside (core checked on satellite 2021-11-16 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-22).</description>
