  <Placemark id="Security_timber.5">
	<name>T05 timber 799 ac</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 51%), 799 ac public, 9,643-10,690 ft, 21% north-facing; median 0.96 mi (max 1.47 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F5-04 meadow 9908 (3.94 mi). Imagery: dense live conifer, aspen pockets (core checked on satellite 2021-11-16 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-22).</description>
