  <Placemark id="Security_timber.7">
	<name>T07 timber 400 ac</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 49%), 400 ac public, 9,995-10,692 ft, 72% north-facing; median 0.82 mi (max 1.22 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F1-02 meadow 9468 (2.94 mi). Imagery: live, some dead crowns mixed in (core checked on satellite 2018-11-09 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-09).</description>
