  <Placemark id="Security_timber.9">
	<name>T09 timber 239 ac (mostly dead)</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 48%), 239 ac public, 10,460-11,076 ft, 76% north-facing; median 0.67 mi (max 1.14 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F4-02 meadow 9233 (10.7 mi). Imagery: mostly dead (gray crowns), not dark timber (core checked on satellite 2023-11-10 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-12).</description>
