  <Placemark id="Security_timber.10">
	<name>T10 timber 205 ac (mostly dead)</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 48%), 205 ac public, 11,351-11,684 ft, 78% north-facing; median 3.01 mi (max 3.36 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F4-02 meadow 9233 (14.82 mi). Imagery: mostly dead (gray crowns), not dark timber (core checked on satellite 2025-04-09 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-12).</description>
