  <Placemark id="Security_timber.11">
	<name>T11 timber 203 ac</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 52%), 203 ac public, 10,378-10,578 ft, 6% north-facing; median 0.63 mi (max 0.86 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F4-01 meadow 9481 (8.51 mi). Imagery: dense young regrowth, roads and cuts at its edges (core checked on satellite 2023-11-10 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-09).</description>
