  <Placemark id="Security_timber.19">
	<name>T19 timber 108 ac</name>
	<description>Dark conifer (NLCD evergreen/mixed, canopy &gt;= 45%, median 48%), 108 ac public, 10,027-10,354 ft, 64% north-facing; median 1.17 mi (max 1.44 mi) from the nearest motorized route. Nearest FEED: F2-02 meadow 9154 (3.54 mi). Imagery: live, moderately dense (core checked on satellite 2017-10-30 and NAIP color-infrared 2019-09-09).</description>
